      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm a bit worried about the \"divisive symbols\" part though. some people might argue that banning certain symbols is actually a way of suppressing their political rights, especially if those symbols are related to social justice issues. how should we frame that in the memo so it doesn't look like we're just trying to silence certain viewpoints in the name of \"cohesion\"?",
